            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> Thanks for PR!\r\n> \r\n> `stopinsert` only exits from Insert and Terminal mode (as documented). There are other modes, like Visual mode. I think `normal! <C-\\><C-n>` should be a better choice. I'll look into it.\r\n\r\nAh good catch. I tested with `normal! <C-\\><C-n>` like you suggest and it seems to do the trick - the `InsertEnter` event isn't fired on start.\r\n\r\nI added a test which fails with `normal! <ESC>` but passes with `normal! <C-\\><C-n>`",
